    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Come dance the night away with GW Chamak! Chamak will host a free dabke
    workshop open to all GW students, lead by Malikat Al Dabke, the first all-women\u2019s
    dabke troupe in the DMV area!!\n\nSnacks and drinks will be provided as well!\_\n\nGW
    Chamak is the only femme-inclusive multicultural dance organization here on campus
    and prioritizes a safe and fun environment for not only our team but also the
    student body. We hope you will have fun celebrating International Dance Day with
    us!"
